  "conclusion": "The native WM_SYSCOMMAND/SC_CLOSE path dispatches a CVI panel close event; absent consumption/gating, the runtime resolves ATTR_CLOSE_CTRL and dispatches event 1 (EVENT_COMMIT) for that control. With ATTR_CLOSE_CTRL=2, this targets control 2.",
